AB  - The road for health informatics has been paved by the digitization of the electronic health record and the development of cloud storage. The key is to ensure the interoperability of health data for maximum data aggregation whereby informatics tools can inform learning health systems, providers, and patients. This requires an appropriate means of communication, a functional learning health system, and an understanding of data types and how they flow through a health system from bench-to-bedside.. © 2024 by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.
