AB  - This paper studies and analyzes how to optimize the ETL (Extract, Transform, and Load) process of the main structure quality inspection data of prefabricated concrete buildings under the framework of data governance, and constructs an efficient data warehouse. By analyzing the existing data governance framework and its applications, combined with the characteristics of the main structure quality inspection data of prefabricated concrete buildings, the paper proposes targeted ETL process optimization solutions and data warehouse construction methods. Through research and practice, it is proved that the optimized ETL process can significantly improve data processing efficiency and accuracy, while the data warehouse constructed provides a solid data foundation for subsequent analysis and warning of quality problems of the main structure of prefabricated concrete buildings.  © 2025 IEEE.
