AB  - The paper describes the proposed work regarding the prioritization need and its strategy for the requirement of data warehouse. The work says that once indicators have been identified that shall contribute in building a data warehouse, we apply an agile approach in selecting indicators in phases that will gradually develop the data warehouse and make it usable/deliverable in parts. Indicator being produced for position higher in the reports or informs hierarchy receives more priority as it might be more helpful in strategy decision-making. Also, an indicator being consumed by more positions get preference as its utility is more. An indicator having more frequency in terms of usage and whose deadline is close by is also preferred as its usage is required more and is required urgently. © 2023, The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Singapore Pte Ltd.
