AB  - This paper covers the topic of Data Architecture and the importance of data in Artificial Intelligence aligned to Decision Support Systems. The emergence of Artificial Intelligence has empowered the decision-making industries, and AI is making this journey transformative. This paper shows the importance of data governance, data quality, scalability, and interoperability in Artificial Intelligence in the respective decision-making in the industry. The other important architectural considerations are data ingestion, data processing, data transformation, data storage, data analytics, data science modeling, and model deployment. In this paper, we additionally cover the challenges of data disparateness, the regulatory aspects, the risks, the compliance, and the real-time predictive analytics, fraud detection, and notification. Data Architecture acts as a central pillar of the AI platform ecosystem, and data architecture ensures seamless data pipelines. This Data Architecture is a combination of Cloud Computing and onpremises. The paper covers the aspects of Data Fabric as part of the data architecture challenges. © 2025 IEEE.
